  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "UVH-26",
  "description": "\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n      ArXiv   |  \n     Models \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n    Models trained on UVH-26 deliver up to 31.5% higher mAP than COCO-pretrained baselines,\n    demonstrating significant gains in real-world performance for Indian traffic scenarios.\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for UVH-26 (Urban Vision Hackathon Dataset)\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nUVH-26 is a large-scale, India-specific traffic-camera image dataset released by AIM @ IISc for research in intelligent transportation systems and vehicle\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/iisc-aim/UVH-26.",
